<h1 class="mb-3">Contact & Support Services</h1>
<p class="lead">These organisations offer free or low-cost support. Reaching out is a sign of strength.</p>

<div class="table-responsive mt-4">
  <table class="table table-hover align-middle">
    <thead class="table-light">
      <tr><th>Organisation</th><th>What They Offer</th><th>How to Reach</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Women's Aid Organisation (WAO)</strong></td>
        <td>Free shelter, counselling and crisis support for women and children</td>
        <td>
          <a href="tel:+60330008858">+603 3000 8858</a> (24 hours)<br>
          <a href="https://wao.org.my" target="_blank" rel="noopener">wao.org.my</a>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Talian Kasih</strong></td>
        <td>National helpline for domestic violence and child abuse</td>
        <td><a href="tel:15999">15999</a> (24 hours)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>AWAM</strong></td>
        <td>Counselling and support for women</td>
        <td><a href="https://wa.me/60162374221">WhatsApp 016-237 4221</a></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Befrienders KL</strong></td>
        <td>Confidential emotional support</td>
        <td><a href="tel:+60376272929">03-7627 2929</a> (24 hours)</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="card bg-light mt-4">
  <div class="card-body">
    <h5>Helping a friend?</h5>
    <ul class="mb-0">
      <li>Listen without judging, and believe what they tell you.</li>
      <li>Do not confront the abuser, as this may increase the danger.</li>
      <li>Share these contacts when it is safe to do so.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>